      "x": null,
      "y": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comment_9a1387ea",
      "info": "Initial research on import substitution shows a shift toward targeted sectors (IT, Defense, CNC/Mechanical Engineering) and a decline in parallel imports for 2025.",
